# Pairs with PendingEventuallyCompletes. A retry that never repairs the
# successor back link cannot safely clear the victim or retire its marker.
MODULE: RepairBackLinkNeverCompletes
TARGET: PendingEventuallyCompletes
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: the successor back link remains stale forever
PERTURBS: RepairBackLink

--- FIND
RepairBackLink ==
    /\ ready
    /\ pending = "victim"
    /\ ~linked
    /\ ~backLinkCorrect
    /\ backLinkCorrect' = TRUE
--- REPLACE
RepairBackLink ==
    /\ ready
    /\ pending = "victim"
    /\ ~linked
    /\ ~backLinkCorrect
    /\ backLinkCorrect' = FALSE
--- END
